~ start
if first == true:
	=>< Introduction
	set first = false
else:
	=>< Reintroduction
if check_feathers():
	What will you do?
	- Why don’t you see for yourself? (Give)
		=>< Give_Dialogue
		do give_feathers()
		do save_npc()
		do disappear()
		=> END
	- Give it up, kid. This world isn’t made for little snots like you. (Take)
		=>< Take_Dialogue
		do take_feathers()
		do doom_player()
		do disappear()
		=> END
	- ... (Ignore)
		=> END
else:
	What will you do?
	- ??? [if check_feathers()]
		=>< Give_Dialogue
		do give_feathers()
		do disappear()
		=> END
	- Give it up, kid. This world isn’t made for little snots like you. (Take)
		=>< Take_Dialogue
		do take_feathers()
		do disappear()
		=> END
	- ... (Ignore)
		=> END

~ Introduction
The Innocent: Wow, hey, mister! What are you doing here?
The Innocent: You’re the first person I’ve seen in such a long time!
The Innocent: Hey, can you do me a favor? 
The Innocent: I can’t quite make it up to that window. Can you tell me what you see? 
The Innocent: I’ve never seen what’s out there, but sometimes I hear birds chirping! I bet it’s really pretty…
 => END

~ Reintroduction
The Innocent: I wonder what’s out there…
The Innocent: I bet it’s really pretty!
 => END

~ Give_Dialogue
The Innocent: Wow, you’re giving me all of these? Thanks, mister!
The Innocent: I’m so excited to see what’s outside! Race ya!


 => END

~ Take_Dialogue
The Innocent: Hey! Wait, mister, that’s mine!
The Innocent: Where are you going?
The Innocent: Don’t leave me alone in here!


 => END